# Paper report style (global)

When creating **documentation HTML, briefings, or styled analytical pages**, apply the **paper-report-style** visual system (fonts, palette, layout chrome only).

Skill: `~/.cursor/skills/paper-report-style/` (`SKILL.md`, `paper-base.css`, `reference.md`).

## Must use

- Fonts: **Archivo** · **IBM Plex Sans** · **IBM Plex Mono**
- Tokens: paper `#EFF2F1`, ink `#141A1C`, accent `#C2661B`, rel `#0E8F73`, fleet `#3A6FD8`, block `#9C3587` (+ dark)
- Chrome: hairlines, 2–4px radius, cost left-accent on decision/callout; KPI band; numbered secheads

Does **not** dictate document content. Does **not** override product app UI unless asked.
